        "type": "github_release",
        "repo": "acidanthera/Lilu",
        "tag": "latest",
        "asset": "Lilu-*-RELEASE.zip"
      },
      "notes": "Patch engine: richiesto da VirtualSMC/WhateverGreen/AppleALC."
